// RUN: cd %corpus && %zomc compile --check 11-error/error_propagate_matching_raises_pos_13.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// `return fail()?!;` where both functions have matching raises clauses is a
// codegen no-op: the error-union aggregate `{tag, payload}` passes through
// unchanged. The `?!` operator unwraps the call's error union to the success
// type, matching the enclosing function's result type. The compiler exits 0.

// CHECK-NOT: Error
